---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---
<article class="project-chapter additional-project subscribe-chapter" aria-labelledby="subscribe-title">
  <div class="project-heading page-frame">
    <div class="project-identity"><span>02 / Subscribe Me</span><span>Car subscription · Mobile app</span></div>
    <h3 id="subscribe-title">Contributing to a<br /> <em>Car Subscription Platform</em></h3>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <div class="subscription-artwork full-project-artwork">
      <img class="subscription-browse" src="/review-images/subscribe-browse-360.webp" width="360" height="1318" alt="Subscribe Me vehicle browsing interface with car availability and monthly pricing." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img class="subscription-detail" src="/review-images/subscribe-detail-800.webp" srcset="/review-images/subscribe-detail-480.webp 480w, /review-images/subscribe-detail-800.webp 800w" sizes="23vw" width="1440" height="2300" alt="Subscribe Me vehicle details and booking interface." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <img class="subscription-dashboard" src="/review-images/subscribe-dashboard-800.webp" srcset="/review-images/subscribe-dashboard-480.webp 480w, /review-images/subscribe-dashboard-800.webp 800w" sizes="23vw" width="1440" height="2700" alt="Subscribe Me subscription dashboard." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </div>
    <figcaption class="visually-hidden">Original Subscribe Me mobile product interfaces.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="featured-story page-frame">
    <div><p class="featured-insight">Designing for the decision,<br /><em>not the transaction.</em></p></div>
    <div class="featured-context">
      <p>Delivered production UI across booking flows, checkout experience, and design system components — stepping in mid-project to maintain delivery across 6 agile sprints.</p>
      <dl class="project-facts"><div><dt>Contribution</dt><dd>UI Designer · Delivery Phase</dd></div><div><dt>Product team</dt><dd>AW Rostamani · RBB Global</dd></div></dl>
      <p class="published-context">Published product outcome: 100K+ downloads. <a href="/case-studies/subscribe-me-case-study.html#outcomes">Case-study reporting context</a></p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/case-studies/subscribe-me-case-study.html">Read Case Study <Arrow /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
<article class="project-chapter additional-project enterprise-chapter" aria-labelledby="utworx-title">
  <div class="project-heading page-frame">
    <div class="project-identity"><span>03 / UTWorX</span><span>Enterprise SaaS · Asset management</span></div>
    <h3 id="utworx-title">Redesigning an enterprise platform <span class="enterprise-title-close">for <em>clarity under complexity.</em></span></h3>
  </div>
  <figure>
    <div class="enterprise-artwork full-project-artwork"><picture>
      <source media="(max-width:650px)" srcset="/review-images/utworx-focus-480.webp 480w, /review-images/utworx-focus-800.webp 800w" sizes="100vw" width="1700" height="1600" />
      <img src="/review-images/utworx-overview-1280.webp" srcset="/review-images/utworx-overview-800.webp 800w, /review-images/utworx-overview-1280.webp 1280w, /review-images/utworx-overview-1920.webp 1920w" sizes="88vw" width="4320" height="4008" alt="UTWorX enterprise dashboard showing work summary and asset overview." loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </picture></div>
    <figcaption class="visually-hidden">Original UTWorX asset and maintenance management interface.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <div class="featured-story enterprise-story page-frame">
    <div><p class="featured-insight">Make the platform easier to use<br /><em>without changing what it does.</em></p></div>
    <div class="featured-context">
      <p>The redesign had to serve three distinct user roles simultaneously — each with different information needs, different frequency of use, and different levels of time pressure.</p>
      <dl class="project-facts"><div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Lead UI/UX Designer</dd></div><div><dt>Delivery scope</dt><dd>16 screens · 3 user roles · 2 weeks</dd></div></dl>
      <p class="published-context">Formal usability metrics were not collected within the two-week scope.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/case-studies/utworx-case-study.html">Read Case Study <Arrow /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
